      ],
      "explanation": "Red/blue aperture tests, separating rather than dyeing light, literal plate I/II references, exact 180-degree formula, complete recombination with suitable geometry, and selected green light are retained. A turn alone is not sufficient; a finite green band can disperse further. No optical geometry or plate identity is approved.",
      "status": "PENDING-INDEPENDENT-SCI-OR-ZHEN-REVIEW"
    },
