      ],
      "explanation": "Violet-largest/red-smallest index and red-fastest/violet-slowest speed are scoped to the ordinary glass/visible-light case. Speed denotes phase speed, not an unconditional signal or photon-trajectory statement. Vacuum colour speeds are distinguished.",
      "status": "PENDING-INDEPENDENT-SCI-OR-ZHEN-REVIEW"
    },
    {
