      "explanation": "Retains white paper, red coating, grass/leaves, sunlight, reflection versus absorption, ideal red-only glass and almost-black observation. 'Only red/green' is marked as the source's idealization; real objects mainly reflect those colours. Assumes ordinary non-emitting, non-colour-converting objects.",
      "status": "PENDING-INDEPENDENT-SCI-OR-ZHEN-REVIEW"
